Z||000009||1FST2M6||05-01-2001||12:57 PM||||if i could change my exhaust back to stock that'd just be me giving in and it would look like and admission of guilt. I've got a recipt for the exhaust thats on there if it were paid for  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> $585 and i've got the CARB and 50 state legal sticker and certificate. I'm going to win this. the douchebag cops picking on somthing as quiet as my car and with the ticket being as subjective as it is theres no way the cop can win. I've got a hold of a friend of mine at a local IASCA stereo shop with his db meter and i'll measure it on tape and put that in as other evidence. the cop tried to tell me that resonated tips are illegal in Ga. i was like ok.. thats fine... mines not resonated.. it's stainless can and explained to him why the exhaust wasn't resonated. neither of us were mean but he already had the ticket written before he got out of his car to approach my car!!! i was like DUDE that was fast! and he wasn't willing to listen to the explination or my paperwork. he was stuck on me just being a punk kid in a POS that would fold to him and apollogize profusly for somthing I didn't do.. uum NO. <P>AND i was sitting outside my office just a minute ago on my lunch (my office is on a Historic City park (Marietta Square)) and what just drove by me... the NEW Cobb county Police Camaros and the Kennesaw City Mustangs are just as loud as my car!!  ||||reg||1
