Z||000050||DJRice||05-04-2001||08:22 AM||||I got pulled over in my white Grand Cherokee at 2am one Saturday night after leaving my g/f's house because the officer thought I passed him going a bit to fast.  He was finishing up another traffic stop at the time.  He followed me for several minutes before pulling me over, Perhaps checking my plate out.  Actually, he told me I was doing 63 in a 45, which is odd because he was outside of his car when I passed him, and I most definitley slowed down anyway because I knew he was there.  (I actually had been doing much more than 63 but slowed down long before I got close to 'the man.'<P>He was just hoping to get lucky and bust some "slim shady."  He told me to be more concious of officers on traffic stops and the speed limit and let me go.  <BR><P>------------------<BR>Dillon<BR>Black '87 SE V6||||reg||1
