Z||000052||87GTZ34||05-04-2001||11:11 AM||||I'm joking about it but I was on my way to the airport in #2 (an '87 GT  w/ 155K mi) one day. I'm not driving fast or anything but a few curious folks drive up next to me trying to get something going.  One of them is a Jeep Cherokee 4.slow I6.  Finally, we come up to a light and he gets next to me.  Now mind you, I don't drive my car hard for fear it will fly apart or something will fall off.  Anyway, he revs his engine at the red light & I think what a dufus...  Anyway, I thought well let me keep just in front of him and see how far he goes w/it.  I do that and he goes all out (well as much as possible for a 4000lb 6 banger).  But he's really abusing his car so finally I look over at him and guess what?  It's a sheriff deputy in uniform and sure enough he turns to go to the station.  Yet another reason not to stir it up...||||reg||1
